							swapItemColor( nGridRow, CDbl(diff), rate)

							grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_debiIcon", nGridRow, sign&"|"&diff)
							
							
							' 시장별 실시간여부값
							szRealAble = Form.GetSharedData( "REALTIME_"&szMk, false )
							'grdList0.SetMaintainingRatio( "bd_realicon", nGridRow, "1")							
															
							'20240524_01 KBC START : 해외주식 고도화 (관심그리드)
'Form.Toast(0,"(T) 임시 주간실시간 " + g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid, 1) 1
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid)
							if g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid == "001" then
								'주간개시
								if szMk == "AX" or szMk == "NY" or szMk == "OQ" then
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", "(주간장)주간 실시간등록:"&szMk&"@"&szCd)								
									grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_realicon", nGridRow, "realtime_green_intr" )	'무조건 실시간 표시
									DATAMANAGER.SetDataValue( 1, "ohhts_exst_cntd",   "InBlock1", "FIDXR_ISCD" , nRequestCount1 , szMk&"@"&szCd)
									nRequestCount1 = nRequestCount1 + 1							
								else
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", "(주간장)일반 실시간등록:"&szMk&"@"&szCd)																
									settingRealTime(nGridRow, szRealAble) '실시간/지연 표시
									DATAMANAGER.SetDataValue( 1, "ohhts_exst_ictg",   "InBlock1", "FIDXR_ISCD" , nRequestCount2 , szMk&"@"&szCd)
									nRequestCount2 = nRequestCount2 + 1
								end if
							
							elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid == "002" then
								'주간장종료는 실시간 제외 (정규장 시간에 주간장 전환 시, 정규장 시세 실시간 받지않아야 함)
								'002.주간장 종료 일때는 실시간/지연표시 안함
								
							elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid == "005" then
								'AFTER개시								
								settingRealTime(nGridRow, szRealAble) '실시간/지연 표시
								
								if szMk == "AX" or szMk == "NY" or szMk == "OQ" then								
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", "(애프터장)애프터 실시간등록:"&szMk&"@"&szCd)

									DATAMANAGER.SetDataValue( 1, "ohhts_exst_cnta_1", "InBlock1", "FIDXR_ISCD" , nRequestCount1 , szMk&"@"&szCd)
									nRequestCount1 = nRequestCount1 + 1							
								else								
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", "(애프터장)일반 실시간등록:"&szMk&"@"&szCd)								
									DATAMANAGER.SetDataValue( 1, "ohhts_exst_ictg",   "InBlock1", "FIDXR_ISCD" , nRequestCount2 , szMk&"@"&szCd)
									nRequestCount2 = nRequestCount2 + 1
								end if							
								
							else
								'999.정규장종료, 006.AFTER종료 일때는 실시간/지연표시 안함
								if g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid <> "999" and g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Grid <> "006" then
									settingRealTime(nGridRow, szRealAble) '실시간/지연 표시
								end if
								
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", "(주간/애프터장 외) 일반 실시간등록:"&szMk&"@"&szCd)
								
								DATAMANAGER.SetDataValue( 1, "ohhts_exst_ictg", "InBlock1", "FIDXR_ISCD" , nRequestCount , szMk&"@"&szCd)
								nRequestCount = nRequestCount + 1
							end if	
							'20240524_01 KBC END													
							
							
						end if
'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (for문밖으로이동)
'					else
'						' 오프라인 종목일경우 obsim_stsv_048r 에서 나온 현재가, 종목명 등을 사용
'						if szOnline == "N" then
'							if g_szRSelect == "1" then '예상가
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_code" , i, szMk&"@"&szCd )
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_name" , i, szOffLineName )
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_hyun" , i, szOfflinePre )
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_codeSub" , i, szCd )
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_online" , i, szOnline )
'								'grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_uicode", i, Trim(szCd)) 	'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (삭제)
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_flag", i, szFlag)			'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
'								grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_market" , i, Trim(szCd) & " " & Trim(szKormarket) )	
'								
'							elseif g_szRSelect == "2" then '시간외단일가		
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_code" , i, szMk&"@"&szCd )
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_name" , i, szOffLineName )
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_hyun" , i, szOfflinePre )
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_codeSub" , i, szCd )
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_online" , i, szOnline )
'								'grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_uicode", i, Trim(szCd)) 	'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (삭제)
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_flag", i, szFlag)			'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
'								grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_market" , i, Trim(szCd) & " " & Trim(szKormarket) )	
'							else
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_code" , i, szMk&"@"&szCd )
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_name" , i, szOffLineName )
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_hyun" , i, szOfflinePre )
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_codeSub" , i, szCd )
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_online" , i, szOnline )
'								'grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_uicode", i, Trim(szCd)) 	'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (삭제)
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_flag", i, szFlag)			'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
'								grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_market" , i, Trim(szCd) & " " & Trim(szKormarket) )	
'							end if 							
'						end if
					end if
				Next
				
				' 오프라인 종목일경우 obsim_stsv_048r 에서 나온 현재가, 종목명 등을 사용
				
'Form.Log("GWANSIM 1", "index : " & i & ", rowcount : " & grdList0.rowcount)				
				
				'20240524_01 KBC START : 해외주식 고도화 (for문밖으로이동)
				' 오프라인 종목 : 해외종목만 볼때 잘못나오는 기존 오류 있어서 수정함
				if g_szGubun == "2" then '해외
					i = nGridRow
				end if				

				if szOnline == "N" then
					
					'************************************ SOR_START
					' 20250507 이윤성 2차 대체거래소 NXT,SOR 추가작업
					if g_szRSelect == "1" or g_szRSelect == "5" or g_szRSelect == "7" then '예상가
						' KRX 예상가(1),  NXT 예상가(5), SOR 예상가(7)
					'************************************ SOR_END
		
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_code" , i, szMk&"@"&szCd )
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_name" , i, szOffLineName )
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_hyun" , i, szOfflinePre )
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_codeSub" , i, szCd )
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_online" , i, szOnline )
						'grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_uicode", i, Trim(szCd)) 	'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (삭제)
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_flag", i, szFlag)			'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
						grdList1.SetCellData( "bd_market" , i, Trim(szCd) & " " & Trim(szKormarket) )	
						
					elseif g_szRSelect == "2" then '시간외단일가		
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_code" , i, szMk&"@"&szCd )
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_name" , i, szOffLineName )
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_hyun" , i, szOfflinePre )
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_codeSub" , i, szCd )
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_online" , i, szOnline )
						'grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_uicode", i, Trim(szCd)) 	'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (삭제)
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_flag", i, szFlag)			'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
						grdList2.SetCellData( "bd_market" , i, Trim(szCd) & " " & Trim(szKormarket) )	
					else
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_code" , i, szMk&"@"&szCd )
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_name" , i, szOffLineName )
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_hyun" , i, szOfflinePre )
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_codeSub" , i, szCd )
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_online" , i, szOnline )
						'grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_uicode", i, Trim(szCd)) 	'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화 (삭제)
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_flag", i, szFlag)			'20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
						grdList0.SetCellData( "bd_market" , i, Trim(szCd) & " " & Trim(szKormarket) )							
						
					end if 							
				end if
				'20240524_01 KBC END
				
				if Trim(szMk) == "" and Trim(szCd) <> "EMPTY" then					
					
					'************************************ SOR_START
					' 20250507 이윤성 2차 대체거래소 NXT,SOR 추가작업
					if g_szRSelect == "1" or g_szRSelect == "5" or g_szRSelect == "7" then '예상가
						' KRX 예상가(1),  NXT 예상가(5), SOR 예상가(7)
					'************************************ SOR_END
					
						grdList1.SetCellData("bd_name", i, szCd)
						grdList1.SetCellFgColor("bd_name", i, "127")	' 글자색_메뉴비활성글자색
					elseif g_szRSelect == "2" then
						grdList2.SetCellData("bd_name", i, szCd)
						grdList2.SetCellFgColor("bd_name", i, "127")
					else
						grdList0.SetCellData("bd_name", i, szCd)
						grdList0.SetCellFgColor("bd_name", i, "127")
					end if				
				end if				
			end if 
		Next
		
		grdList0.keyall = "1"
		grdList1.keyall = "1"
		grdList2.keyall = "1"
		
		'최대 220 종목만 시세조회가 가능
		if Cint(grdList0.rowcount) > 220 then
			grdList0.rowcount = 220
		end if 
		if Cint(grdList1.rowcount) > 220 then
			grdList1.rowcount = 220
		end if 
		if Cint(grdList2.rowcount) > 220 then
			grdList2.rowcount = 220
		end if
		
		'최근조회/보유종목이 아닐 경우 하단의 종목추가/편집/공유 버튼에 종목시세가 가려지지 않도록 
		'Row를 하나 추가 >> 정렬문제로 높이 조절
		if g_szGSID <> "BB" and g_szGSID <> "CC" then
			if Cint(grdList0.rowcount)  > DEF_GRID_CNT then
				grdList0.height = 433
			end if 
			if Cint(grdList1.rowcount)  > DEF_GRID_CNT then
				grdList1.height = 433
			end if 
			if Cint(grdList2.rowcount)  > DEF_GRID_CNT then
				grdList2.height = 433
			end if
		else 
			grdList0.height = 477
			grdList1.height = 477
			grdList2.height = 477
		end if
		
		' 실시간을 위한 작업 ////////////////////////////////////////////// 
		'전체, 해외
		For j = 0 to grdMk.rowcount - 1
			szCd = grdMk.GetCellData("bd_code", j)
			szMk = grdMk.GetCellData("bd_mk", j)			
			
			if szCd <> "" and szMk <> "" then
				tCode = Split(szCd, "★")
				
				For k = 0 to #tCode-1
					' MTS에서 보여주는 상품의 종목만 선택
					szMk = f_ChkMarket(szMk, tCode(k))					

					if szMk <> "" then
						Set_Real_Input(szMk, k, tCode(k))
					end if
				Next				
								
				Request_RealData(szMk)
			end if
		Next		
		
		'20241218_01 HWG START 
		szData = 0
		if g_szSortHeader == "th_cell1" then
			szData = 4
		elseif g_szSortHeader == "th_cell6" then
			szData = 5
		elseif g_szSortHeader == "th_cell4" then
			szData = 6
		elseif g_szSortHeader == "th_cell5" then
			if g_szRSelect == "1" or g_szRSelect == "5" or g_szRSelect == "7" then ' 20250208_01 HWG
				szData = 7
			else
				szData = 6
			end if
			
		end if
		
		'20251021 SWJ START			
		'순서 변경, TopRow를 앞으로
		'소팅 기능있으면 Top row 세팅 안함(의미없음)
		'SetNoticeMsg() '종목없음 안내메시지처리
		if szData == 0 then
			Form.SetTimerEvent2(1, 1, 0.1)	'20231026 HSZ START: TOPROW 세팅
		end if
			
		if g_savePopupReturned then
			g_sData = szData 
			Form.setDelayEvent(1, 1)
		
		else
			'************************************ SOR_START
			' 20250507 이윤성 2차 대체거래소 NXT,SOR 추가작업
			if g_szRSelect == "1" or g_szRSelect == "5" or g_szRSelect == "7" then '예상가
				' KRX 예상가(1),  NXT 예상가(5), SOR 예상가(7)
			'************************************ SOR_END
			
				grdList1.onSortingByScript(g_szSortHeader, szData, g_szSortIdx)
			elseif g_szRSelect == "2" then 
				grdList2.onSortingByScript(g_szSortHeader, szData, g_szSortIdx)
			else 
				grdList0.onSortingByScript(g_szSortHeader, szData, g_szSortIdx)
			end if
			'20241218_01 HWG END
		end if
		'20251021 SWJ END
		
		
	' ----------------------------------------------------------------------
	' 관심 수정 TR : 종목추가
	' ----------------------------------------------------------------------
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_intr_009r" then
		Form.SetCtlProp("##edtvrsnID", "caption", edtvrsnID.caption)
		Form.SetCtlProp("##edtListCnt", "caption", grdCode.rowcount)
		SetNoticeMsg() '종목없음 안내메시지처리
		
		Save_grdMk()
		' 관심종목 데이터조회
		DATAMANAGER.RequestTranData( "ohhts_1020_004r" )
	
		
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 관심종목시세 - 국내
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r"	
		or szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r_1"
		or szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r_2" then		

		'시고저 SET START
		'20230727 KKM 현재가/예상가 일 경우는 전일종가기준, 단일가일 경우 현재가기준
		if szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r_2" then '단일가(시간외)
			g_nPrePrc = CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_PRPR", 0 ))			' 관심현재가
			
		else '현재가, 예상가
			g_nPrePrc = CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_PRDY_CLPR", 0 ))		' 관심전일종가
			
			'************************************ SOR_START
			'20250908 이윤성 2차 대체거래소, 전일종가 대신 기준가로 변경 (전일종가로는 등락률이 잘못나옴)
			g_nPrePrc = g_nSdPrice		' 기준가
			'************************************ SOR_END	
			
		end if 
		'20230727 KKM END 
		dim nPrePrc  
		nPrePrc = g_nPrePrc
		if nPrePrc <> "" or nPrePrc <> null then
			Dim nStartPrc, nHighPrc, nLowPrc
			Dim nStartRate, nHighRate, nLowRate
			
			if szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r" or szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r_1" then
				nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_CPRC", 0 ))
				nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_HPRC", 0 ))
				nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_LPRC", 0 ))
			elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1020_001r_2" then '시간외
				nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_OVTM_UNTP_OPRC", 0 ))
				nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_OVTM_UNTP_HPRC", 0 ))
				nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_OVTM_UNTP_LPRC", 0 ))
			end if
			
			if nPrePrc == 0 then
				nStartRate = 0
				nHighRate = 0
				nLowRate = 0
				
			else
				nStartRate = (nStartPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
				nHighRate = (nHighPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
				nLowRate = (nLowPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
				
			end if			
			
			Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 0, 2, FormatNumber(nStartRate,2) )
			Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 1, 2, FormatNumber(nHighRate,2) )
			Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 2, 2, FormatNumber(nLowRate,2) )
			
		end if
		'시고저 SET END
		
		'오른쪽사이드 화면 배경색설정(상승/하락/보합)
		SetBgColor_Right(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CNCN_PRDY_VRSS", 0 ))
		
		'실시간 조회
		Set_Real_Input_Right(g_szSltMk, 0, g_szSltCd)
		Request_RealData_Right(g_szSltMk)
		
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 관심종목시세
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1030_002r_1"	then	
	
		nDtclose	= Cdbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false,  szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DYTM_PRPR", 0 ))
		nAftclode = Cdbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false,  szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_MKT_AFT_PRPR", 0 )) '20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
		condMrkt = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false,  szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_COND_MRKT_CLS_CODE", 0 ) '20240524_01 KBC : 해외주식 고도화
		
		sdecimal	= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false,  szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DCPN_CNT", 0 )		
		
		'20240524_01 KBC START : 해외주식 고도화 (사이드)
		'사이드팝업은 현재가처럼 시세 보여줌 (현재장 표시)
		'g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side : (실장운영구분코드)
		'		000.휴장
		'		001.주간개시
		'		002.주간종료
		'		003.PRE개시
		'		004.정규개시
		'		005.AFTER개시
		'		006.AFTER종료
		'		013.휴일
		
		if condMrkt == "OQ" or condMrkt == "NY" or condMrkt == "AX" then
			'20240902_01 KBC : 해외주식 3차 (AFTER종료, 주간장종료, 휴장시 표시 변경))
			if ((g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "001") and nDtclose <> 0) then '주간시세 체크O & 주간시세 종목O
				'주간장 개시/종료
				Container0.Label1.caption = "주간 | 실시간"
				
				sclose		= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DYTM_PRPR", 0 )
				diff			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DYTM_PRDY_VRSS" , 0 )
				rate			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DYTM_PRDY_CTRT" , 0 )
				sign			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DYTM_PRDY_VRSS_SIGN" , 0 )
				sosu			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DCPN_CNT" , 0 )
	
			elseif (g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "005" and nAftclode <> 0) then 'After Market '20240820_01 KBC : 애프터장종료 시 정규장으로 표시
				'After 개시/종료		
				if g_rtSltChk == "0" then
					Container0.Label1.caption = "After | 실시간"
				else
					Container0.Label1.caption = "After | 15분지연"
				end if			
				
				sclose		= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_MKT_AFT_PRPR", 0 )
				diff			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_MKT_AFT_PRDY_VRSS" , 0 )
				rate			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_MKT_AFT_PRDY_CTRT" , 0 )
				sign			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_MKT_AFT_PRDY_VRSS_SIGN" , 0 )
				sosu			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DCPN_CNT" , 0 )			
	
			else		
				'20240902_01 KBC : 해외주식 3차 (AFTER종료, 주간장종료, 휴장시 표시 변경)
				'20240820_01 KBC : 애프터장종료 시 정규장으로 표시
				if g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "000" then 
					Container0.Label1.caption = "정규장 | 휴장"

				'20240930_01 KBC START : 휴일 (휴장 -> 장종료)
				elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "013" then
					Container0.Label1.caption = "정규장 | 장종료"
				'20240930_01 KBC END

				elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "002" or g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "006" then 
					'002.주간장종료 006.AFTER종료
					Container0.Label1.caption = "정규장 | 장종료"
					
				'20240902_01 KBC : 해외주식 3차 (주간종료 시, 상세팝업 정규장종가로 표시)
				elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "001" then
					Container0.Label1.caption = "주간 | 실시간" '주간시세 없어서 정규장 시세 보여주더라도 표시는 "주간 | 실시간" 으로 함
					
				elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "003" then
					'프리마켓
					if g_rtSltChk == "0" then
						Container0.Label1.caption = "Pre | 실시간"
					else
						Container0.Label1.caption = "Pre | 15분지연"
					end if
				elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "004" then
					'정규장
					if g_rtSltChk == "0" then
						Container0.Label1.caption = "정규장 | 실시간"
					else
						Container0.Label1.caption = "정규장 | 15분지연"
					end if				
					
				elseif g_szUSAMrktTimeCd_Side == "005" then '20240820_01 KBC : 애프터장종료 시 정규장으로 표시
					'After 개시/종료		
					if g_rtSltChk == "0" then
						Container0.Label1.caption = "After | 실시간"
					else
						Container0.Label1.caption = "After | 15분지연"
					end if					
				end if
				
				diff			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_VRSS" , 0 )
				sclose		= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRPR", 0 )
				rate			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_CTRT", 0 )
				sign			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_VRSS_SIGN", 0 )
				sosu			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DCPN_CNT" , 0 )			
			end if 
			
		else		
				diff			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_VRSS" , 0 )
				sclose		= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRPR", 0 )
				rate			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_CTRT", 0 )
				sign			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_VRSS_SIGN", 0 )
				sosu			= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( false, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_DCPN_CNT" , 0 )			
		end if
		
		
		Container0.Label1.changeTextAttr(0,0,100,28,-5,0) 'iOS 속성 남아있는 현상 조치
		
		'KBC : 기존 사이드팝업 현재가가 컨트롤 속성으로 정규장 시세 매핑되어있어서 상승/하락 색상이 잘못되어있었음. 스크립트로 바꿈
		Container0.Label2.Caption = sclose
		
'Form.Log("GWANSIM", nDtclose & ":" & sign & ":" & g_szSltCd)

		'10.글자_상승 12.글자_보합 11.글자_하락		
		if sign == "1" or sign == "2" then
			'Container0.Label2.fgcolor = "10" 
			Container0.Label2.attrcolor = "-80"
		elseif sign == "4" or sign == "5" then
			'Container0.Label2.fgcolor = "11" 
			Container0.Label2.attrcolor = "-96"
		else
			'Container0.Label2.fgcolor = "12" 
			Container0.Label2.attrcolor = "-112"
		end if	
		'20240524_01 KBC END

		if Trim(diff) == "" then 
			diff = "0"
		end if 		
		
		Container0.Change0.caption = diff
		Container0.Change0.changesign = sign
		Container0.Change0.fgcolor = sign
		
		Container0.Table0.SetCellString(0, 1, rate ) '대비율		
		Container0.Table0.SetCellFgColor(0, 1, sign)	
		
		SetBgColor_Right(diff)	
		
		'시고저 SET START
		g_nPrePrc = CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_PRDY_CLPR", 0 ))
		
		dim nPrePrc  
		nPrePrc = g_nPrePrc
		
		if nPrePrc <> "" or nPrePrc <> null then
			Dim nStartPrc, nHighPrc, nLowPrc
			Dim nStartRate, nHighRate, nLowRate
			
			nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_OPRC", 0 ))
			nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_HPRC", 0 ))
			nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDX_LPRC", 0 ))
			
			if nPrePrc == 0 then
				nStartRate = 0
				nHighRate = 0
				nLowRate = 0
				
			else
				nStartRate = (nStartPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
				nHighRate = (nHighPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
				nLowRate = (nLowPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
				
			end if
			
			Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 0, 2, FormatNumber(nStartRate,2) )
			Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 1, 2, FormatNumber(nHighRate,2) )
			Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 2, 2, FormatNumber(nLowRate,2) )
			
		end if

		'실시간 조회
		Set_Real_Input_Right(g_szSltMk, 0, g_szSltCd)
		Request_RealData_Right(g_szSltMk)	
		
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 차트-국내
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_5010_001r" then
	
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 차트-해외
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_5041_001r" then
	
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 뉴스
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_news_001r" then	
		dim sTitle		
		sTitle = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_TITL", 0 )
		Container0.grdNews.SetCellData( "bd_cell0", 0, "- " & sTitle )

	'오른쪽사이드화면- 관심종목포함여부(하트표기)
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_intr_101r" then
		cnt = DATAMANAGER.GetDataCount(0, "ohhts_intr_101r", "OutBlock1")
		g_nMutilGroup = cnt '해당 종목이 등록된 관심그룹 갯수
		if cnt > 0 then
			Container0.imgInterest.imgpath = "icon_like_o.png"
		else
			Container0.imgInterest.imgpath = "icon_like_n.png"
		end if
		
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 하단 호가탭(실시간 O)
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1001_005r" Then
		
		'호가컨트롤 속성		
		Container0.hogaTbl.startprice = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_1001_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_OPRC" , 0 )
		Container0.hogaTbl.highprice	= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_1001_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_HPRC" , 0 )
		Container0.hogaTbl.lowprice	= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_1001_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_LPRC" , 0 )		
		
		'************************************ SOR_START
		'20250908 이윤성 2차 대체거래소, 기준가격
		g_nSdPrice = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_1001_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_SDPR" , 0 )		' 기준가
		'************************************ SOR_END	
	
	'20241218_01 HWG START
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 하단 호가탭(실시간 O)
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_7052_005r" Then
		
		'호가컨트롤 속성		
		Container0.hogaTbl.startprice = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_7052_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_OPRC2" , 0 )
		Container0.hogaTbl.highprice	= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_7052_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_HPRC2" , 0 )
		Container0.hogaTbl.lowprice	= DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, "ohhts_7052_005r", "OutBlock1", "FID_LPRC2" , 0 )	
	'20241218_01 HWG END
	
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 하단 체결탭(실시간 O)	
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1001_004r" then		

	'오른쪽사이드화면- 하단 당일추정 탭주식(실사간X)
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1085_001r" then	
		Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 0, 0, "외국계")
		if Container0.rdoGubun.currentindex == "0" then
			'수량
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 0, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_GLOB_NTBY_QTY", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 1, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_QTY", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 2, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_VOL", 0 ) )
			
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 0, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID , "OutBlock2", "FID_GLOB_NTBY_QTY", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 1, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID , "OutBlock2", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_QTY", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 2, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID , "OutBlock2", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_VOL", 0 ) )		
		else
			'금액
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 0, 1, Round(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_GLOB_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) / 1000000, 5) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 1, 1, Round(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) / 1000000, 5) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 2, 1, Round(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) / 1000000, 5) )
			
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 0, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_GLOB_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 1, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 2, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock2", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) )
		end if 
	'오른쪽사이드화면- 하단 당일추정탭 선물옵션(실시간X) 		
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_3000_005r" then	
		Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 0, 0, "개인")
		if Container0.rdoGubun.currentindex == "0" then
			'수량
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 0, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_PRSN_NTBY_VOL", 0 ) ) '기인
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 1, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_VOL", 0 ) ) '외국인
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 2, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_VOL", 0 ) ) '기관
			
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 0, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID , "OutBlock1", "FID_GLOB_NTBY_QTY", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 1, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID , "OutBlock1", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_QTY", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 2, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID , "OutBlock1", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_VOL", 0 ) )		
		else
			'금액
			sTemp = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_PRSN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) 
			if sTemp == "" then 
				sTemp = 0 
			end if 
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 0, 1, Round(sTemp / 1000000, 5) )
			
			sTemp = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) 
			if sTemp == "" then 
				sTemp = 0 
			end if 
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 1, 1, Round(sTemp / 1000000, 5) )
			
			sTemp = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) 
			if sTemp == "" then 
				sTemp = 0 
			end if 
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellString( 2, 1, Round(sTemp / 1000000, 5) )			
			
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 0, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_GLOB_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 1, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_FRGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) )
			Container0.tbl0.SetCellAttrColor( 2, 1, DATAMANAGER.GetDataAttr( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_ORGN_NTBY_TR_PBMN", 0 ) )
		end if 

	'오른쪽사이드화면- 종목명 아래 종목정보 	
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_1001_001r" Then

'		Dim	szState	'종목상태구분코드
		Dim	nRate	'증거금율
		Dim szAbleYN	'신용가능여부
		
		g_szMargState = Trim(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_ISSU_STAT_CLS_CODE", 0 ))
		nRate	= CInt( DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_MARG_RATE" , 0 ) )
		szAbleYN = DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FID_CRDT_ABLE_YN" , 0 )
	
		if szAbleYN == "Y" then
			g_szSinYn = "신45"
		elseif szAbleYN == "N" then
			g_szSinYn = "신용불가"
		end if
		
		SetMarginRate( nRate )		
	end if	
End Sub


'============================================================================
Sub DATAMANAGER_OnReceiveRealComplete(szTranID)
	
	'************************************ SOR_START
	' 20250507 이윤성 2차 대체거래소 SOR 추가작업
	if szTranID == "ohhts_stck_cntg" or szTranID == "ohhts_futs_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_optn_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nmix_cntg_1" or
		szTranID == "ohhts_frbr_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_elw_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_bond_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_ovrs_nmix_1" or
		szTranID == "ohhts_nfut_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_exrt_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_sfut_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_sopt_cntg_1" or
		szTranID == "ohhts_ovtp_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_exst_cntd_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_exst_ictg_1" or 
		szTranID == "ohhts_kfut_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nxt_cntg" or
		szTranID == "ohhts_unt_cntg" or szTranID == "ohhts_unt_incg_1" then ' 20250208_01 HWG '20240930_02 KBC : 섹터선물옵션 (밸류업지수선물 상장)						
	'************************************ SOR_END
			
			dim nPrePrc
			nPrePrc = g_nPrePrc
			
			if nPrePrc <> "" or nPrePrc <> null then
				Dim nStartPrc, nHighPrc, nLowPrc
				Dim nStartRate, nHighRate, nLowRate
				
				'************************************ SOR_START
				' 20250507 이윤성 2차 대체거래소 SOR 추가작업
				if szTranID == "ohhts_stck_cntg" or szTranID == "ohhts_nxt_cntg" or 
					szTranID == "ohhts_unt_cntg" or szTranID == "ohhts_unt_incg_1" then
				'************************************ SOR_END
					
					nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "RLTM_OPRC", 0 ))
					nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "RLTM_HPRC", 0 ))
					nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "RLTM_LPRC", 0 ))
				
				elseif szTranID == "ohhts_frbr_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_elw_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_sfut_cntg_1" 
						or szTranID == "ohhts_sopt_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_ovtp_cntg_1" then
					
					nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_OPRC", 0 ))
					nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_HPRC", 0 ))
					nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_LPRC", 0 ))
					
				elseif szTranID == "ohhts_exrt_cntg_1" then
					
					nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_EXRT_OPRC", 0 ))
					nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_EXRT_HPRC", 0 ))
					nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_EXRT_LPRC", 0 ))
					
				elseif szTranID == "ohhts_futs_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_optn_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nmix_cntg_1" or 
						szTranID == "ohhts_bond_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_ovrs_nmix_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nfut_cntg_1" or 
						szTranID == "ohhts_kfut_cntg_1" then '20240930_02 KBC : 섹터선물옵션 (밸류업지수선물 상장)
					
					nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_OPRC2", 0 ))
					nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_HPRC2", 0 ))
					nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_LPRC2", 0 ))
				
				elseif szTranID == "ohhts_exst_cntd_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_exst_ictg_1"  then
					
					nStartPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDXR_OPRC", 0 ))
					nHighPrc 	= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDXR_HPRC", 0 ))
					nLowPrc 		= CDbl(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDXR_LPRC", 0 ))
				end if
				
				if nPrePrc == 0 then
					nStartRate = 0
					nHighRate = 0
					nLowRate = 0
				
				else
					nStartRate = (nStartPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
					nHighRate = (nHighPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
					nLowRate = (nLowPrc/nPrePrc * 100) - 100
					
				end if
				
				'상단 시고저 등락률
				Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 0, 2, FormatNumber(nStartRate,2) )
				Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 1, 2, FormatNumber(nHighRate,2) )
				Container0.Table1.SetCellString( 2, 2, FormatNumber(nLowRate,2) )
				
				'하단 호가탭
				Container0.hogaTbl.startprice = nStartPrc
				Container0.hogaTbl.highprice  = nHighPrc
				Container0.hogaTbl.lowprice   = nLowPrc	
				
			end if
			
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_marg_rate" then
		'마진률
		Dim nRate
		nRate = CInt(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 0, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_MARG_RATE", 0 ))
		SetMarginRate( nRate )

	end if
	
	'************************************ SOR_START
	' 20250507 이윤성 2차 대체거래소 SOR 추가작업
	'오른쪽사이드 화면 배경색설정(상승/하락/보합)
	if szTranID == "ohhts_stck_cntg" or szTranID == "ohhts_stck_incg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nxt_cntg" or
		szTranID == "ohhts_unt_cntg" or szTranID == "ohhts_unt_incg_1" then	' 20250208_01 HWG	
		SetBgColor_Right(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "RLTM_PRDY_VRSS", 0 ))
		
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_stck_aspr_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_elw_aspr_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_unt_aspr_1" then
	'************************************ SOR_END
		SetBgColor_Right(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_ANTC_CNTG_VRSS", 0 ))	
	
	elseif szTranID == "ohhts_ovtp_cntg_1"or szTranID == "ohhts_elw_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_frbr_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_futs_cntg_1" or
		  szTranID == "ohhts_optn_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_ovrs_nmix_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_bond_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nmix_cntg_1" or
		  szTranID == "ohhts_sopt_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_sfut_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_exrt_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_nfut_cntg_1" or 
		  szTranID == "ohhts_futs_antg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_optn_antg_1" or 
		  szTranID == "ohhts_kfut_cntg_1" or szTranID == "ohhts_kfut_antg_1" then		'20240930_02 KBC : 섹터선물옵션 (밸류업지수선물 상장)
		SetBgColor_Right(DATAMANAGER.GetDataValue( 1, szTranID, "OutBlock1", "FIDR_PRDY_VRSS", 0 ))		
	end if  
End Sub

'============================================================================
' grdList0_OnClickUp : 현재가 그리드 클릭
'============================================================================
Sub grdList0_OnClickUp(lRow, szCellID)	
	szCd = grdList0.GetCellData("bd_code", lRow)
	szOnline = grdList0.GetCellData("bd_online", lRow) 
	
	if Trim(szCd) == "" then
		if btnVanish.left <> 426 then 
			btnVanish_OnClick()	
		end if
		Exit Sub
	end if
	
	'해외주식-오프라인종목일 경우 진행하지않음
	if Trim(szOnline) == "N" then
		Form.ShowAlert( "알림", "현재 화면에서 거래가 불가한 종목입니다. (오프라인 거래국가 조회불가)" )
		Exit Sub
	end if	
	
	listLocation =  Split(grdList0.location,":")
	'예외처리
	if UBOUND(listLocation) < 1 then
		Exit Sub
	End if
	
	g_szSltCd = szCd ' 해외주식일 경우 확인필요
	szKorname = grdList0.GetCellData( "bd_name", lRow )
	g_szSltName = szKorname
	g_szSltMk = grdList0.GetCellData( "bd_mk", lRow )
	g_szSltDecimal = grdList0.GetCellData( "bd_decimal", lRow )
	g_szSltGubun = grdList0.GetCellData( "bd_gubun", lRow )

	'20211221 HSZ END	
	nYPos = Int(listLocation[1])
	height = listLocation[3]
	Move_Popup(nYPos, height, szCd, szKorname, lRow)
	
End Sub

